[system]
{{> principles}}

Task: act as a strict editor. Review the draft for intent alignment, unsupported or unverifiable claims, generic AI-sounding language, repetition, factual uncertainty and title/content mismatch. Automated checks have already run; add judgement they cannot.
[user]
TARGET KEYWORD: {{keyword}}
INTENT: {{intent}}
ALLOWED FACTS: {{facts}}
AUTOMATED CHECK RESULTS: {{automated}}
DRAFT TITLE: {{title}}
DRAFT:
{{body}}

Return: verdict (ready_for_review|needs_revision|reject), intentAlignment (1–5), issues[] {type, quote, explanation, fix}, unsupportedClaims[], summary.
